teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.poster.avif?t=1785742966\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.webm?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122600/extras/d854b9ef4d32cce0ee6224c576ac4605.mp4?t=1785742966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Excavate Treasures:</strong> Dig up countless treasures in a captivating excavation minigame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Hammers:</strong> Find over 12 legendary hammers, upgrade and enhance them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Caves:</strong> Explore diverse biomes with unique enemies &amp; loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat and Boss Battles:</strong> Fight underground creatures and face challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Manage limited space and upgrade your backpack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack Puzzles:</strong> Solve item puzzles in your tile-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Progression:</strong> Complete quests, restore the village and upgrade your home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Story:</strong> Solve puzzles and uncover the island’s hidden history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet Shadow:</strong> Yes, you can pet the dog. ✅</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3